   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xE9;sultats obtenus jusqu&#x2019;en d&#xE9;cembre 2022 : 1) am&#xE9;lior&#xE9; l&#x2019;acc&#xE8;s aux services de sant&#xE9; et d&#x2019;&#xE9;ducation pour les femmes et leurs enfants; 2) augment&#xE9; la participation active des femmes dans le d&#xE9;veloppement &#xE9;conomique au sein de leur communaut&#xE9;. &#xC0; noter que 198 femmes ont pu profiter de ce projet soutenant le renforcement de leur pouvoir &#xE9;conomique; 3) augment&#xE9; les pratiques de promotion et de d&#xE9;fense des droits de la femme et de l&#x2019;enfant dans la communaut&#xE9;.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of December 2022 include: (1) improved access to health and education services for women and their children; (2) increased active participation of women in economic development within their communities. It should be noted that 198 women benefited from this project, which helped them strengthen their economic power; and (3) increase in practices for promoting and defending the rights of women and children in the community.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
